two oars.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 08:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>8 (number) - New World Encyclopedia</title><link>https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/8_(number)</link><description>Eight is the dimension of the octonions and is the highest possible dimension of a normed division algebra. The number 8 is involved with a number of interesting mathematical phenomena related to the notion of Bott periodicity.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:02:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>